{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Tout s'est bien passé (Everything Went Fine)","Emmanuèle, romancière épanouie dans sa vie privée et professionnelle, se précipite à l’hôpital, son père André vient de faire un AVC. Fantasque, aimant passionnément la vie mais diminué, il demande à sa fille de l’aider à en finir. Avec l’aide de sa sœur Pascale, elle va devoir choisir : accepter la volonté de son père ou le convaincre de changer d’avis. (When André, 85, has a stroke, Emmanuèle hurries to her father’s bedside. Sick and half-paralyzed in his hospital bed, he asks Emmanuèle to help him end his life. But how can you honor such a request when it’s your own father?)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"parenthood","suicide","physical illness","lgbtqi","hospital","cultural memory","agony","may-december","medical treatment",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":20,"filmType":24,"directors":25,"genre":59,"media":61,"synopsis":64,"production":67,"characters":70,"roles":98,"awards":183,"tags":3},"Film","FR2021_072","fr2021-072-tout-s-est-bien-passe",{"native":18,"english":19},"Tout s'est bien passé","Everything Went Fine",{"type":21,"date":22,"year":23},"Theatrical release","2021-09-22",2021,"Fiction film",[26],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":29,"deathYear":30,"gender":31,"nationality":32,"awards":33},"François Ozon","francois-ozon",1967,0,"Male identifying","France",[34,43,48,53],{"film":35,"year":39,"award":40,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":36,"title":37},"fr2020-045-ete-85",{"native":38},"Summer of 85",2020,"European Film Awards","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":44,"year":23,"award":47,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":36,"title":45},{"native":46},"Été 85","César du cinéma",{"film":49,"year":39,"award":47,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":50,"title":51},"fr2019-036-grace-a-dieu",{"native":52},"Grâce à Dieu",{"film":54,"year":58,"award":47,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":55,"title":56},"fr2016-12